<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50965" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσθμ-ιάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
		pecul. fem. of foreg., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					8(7).3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ Ἰ. σπονδαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἰ</span>. (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑορτή</span>) the <i>Isthmian festival</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				46.10
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ Ἰσθμιάδες</span>,=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ Ἴσθμια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.33
			</span></i>; <i>a period of two years</i>, between each celebration of
			the games, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				2.7.2
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
